        "slc_45b5c4230d9fe8b50f21574e8becd0cb09e48345d12e76bd3bfa56e9097b009e"
      ],
      "text": "The backend is split into six pip-installable packages (core, models, services, agents, api, worker) with a layered dependency graph where agena-core has no internal deps and agena-api depends on all others."
    },
    {
