        "slc_e6e56723d2da26e940376bfaa834f5e1ea72c7cb6e29c01372e0bfe07920226c"
      ],
      "text": "Completed tasks are distilled into reusable skills stored as Qdrant embeddings (org-scoped, kind='skill') plus MySQL rows; before any agent runs, the top-3 skills above a relevance threshold are prepended to the system prompt."
    },
    {
