        "slc_f99400adfd962ba0035a3f07b00acc18ae964128c1532da7721fae25da0591e2"
      ],
      "text": "A Skill Librarian asks the configured LLM to summarize completed tasks into structured skill records, and extraction is skipped when the LLM's confidence is below 50% to avoid polluting the catalog."
    },
